00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:57.040
{OP}

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:03.240
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.710
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.600
Every day it sparkles

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:14.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:21.200
