00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.180
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.590
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:59.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:02.220
What's more than just cute

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:06.100
