00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:55.040
After all, I was <i>such</i> a handful as a baby.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.530
This is but a fraction of my endless gratitude.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.130
Thank you ever so much.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:04.100
But your mother wouldn't <i>be</i> a mother without you.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.070
