00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.460
Raising a child made me worry and doubt myself,

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.050
but I learned a lot about parenting.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:17.750
I feel that both parents and children strive together to become a family.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.680
But a word of advice.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.540
Make sure you smile in front of the baby.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:24.290
Smile?

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:29.990
If the mother looks disheartened, the baby's sure to worry.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.520
I see.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.790
Oh, she woke up.

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.470
I'll finish up here, so go to her.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.530
Yeah.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.880
My baby pictures aren't too flattering.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:47.640
