00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:14.130
Oh, no matter how big you get, you're still Mommy's little girl.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.730
My precious little angel.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:20.890
Sometimes I had Yuuzou care for you when you wouldn't stop crying

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:23.210
