Self?

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.740
How dare you make our little Ai cry!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.700
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:54.180
Self?!

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:58.100
Diamond Swirkle! {A Swirkle is an actual drinke or something: http://www.thefreelibrary.com/Tully%27s+Coffee+Says,+%22Be+Cool,+With+The+Swirkle%22%3B+Icy+New+Coffee...-a018298033}

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:09.290
Seeeeeeelf!

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.760
Now is our chance!

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:28.070
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:44.300
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:57.010
Lovroom lovroom lovroooooom!

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:09.850
Man, now <i>I</i> wanna cry!

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.880
Ai's sleeping well.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:17.530
She looks so much nicer when she's finally calmed down.

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:20.900
We caught a break and won the battle today,

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.400
but we might not be so lucky next time.

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:30.170
Why did Ai's tears weaken us and strengthen the enemy's Egogy?

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.110
We need to find out and stop it.

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:34.520
Huh?

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.080
The Mirror Lovies!

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:40.000
Give it a try!

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:44.170
Dibbity dobbity Davi!

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:55.570
Huh?

00:21:58.030 --> 00:21:59.350
The princess!

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:00.500
Princess Ann!

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:04.250
{ED}

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:08.820
Ai is teething!

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:11.430
Now she'll be able to eat ever tastier sweets!

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:12.840
She's too young for those!

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:16.680
It's best to teach her to brush her teeth first to prevent cavities.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:18.900
I think I got one before Ai did!

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.140
Wait, Makopi, you've got a cavity?

00:22:21.140 --> 00:22:23.080
Then we should go to the dentist!

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:24.970
But dentists are scary!

00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:28.690
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:31.500
Ai's Being Stubborn!

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:31.500
Ai's Being Stubborn!

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:33.320
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
